{:kotoba.capability-kit/name :http
 :kotoba.capability-kit/version 1
 :capability {:name :http/post :id 4}
 :semantics {:operation :post
             :schemes #{:https}
             :destination-authority :host-exact-origin-allowlist
             :redirects :transport-must-not-follow-outside-allowlist
             :ambient-network false
             :execution :synchronous-reference}
 :limits {:url-bytes 4096 :headers 32 :body-bytes 65536 :timeout-ms [1 30000]}
 :request
 [:record :kotoba.http/post-request
  [[:url :string]
   [:headers [:set [:record :kotoba.http/header
                    [[:name :keyword] [:value :string]]]]]
   [:body :string]
   [:timeout-ms :i64]]]
 :result
 [:variant :kotoba.http/result
  [[:ok [:record :kotoba.http/response
          [[:status :i64]
           [:headers [:set [:record :kotoba.http/header
                            [[:name :keyword] [:value :string]]]]]
           [:body :string]]]]
   [:error [:record :kotoba.http/error
             [[:code :keyword] [:message :string] [:retryable :bool]]]]]]
 :qualification {:reference :implemented
                 :wasm-aot :partial
                 :native-aot :pending
                 :jit :pending
                 :signed-content-addressed-package :ready
                 :notes "ADR 0162/0165; 0171 bounds; 0182–0193 typed packing; 0194–0198 pure memory-scan; 0199–0204 pure Component re-emit of all policy packages + request/result packing walks (no kotoba:typed). ADR 0209/0210/0211 fixed-depth nested EDN encode (header, multi-header append+name uniqueness scan, request, result ok/err). Host I/O authority. ADR 0212 Component twin first slice (string-expression). ADR 0213 multi-export EDN trust package (:string-expression-package). ADR 0214 reject-path edn_quoted Component. ADR 0215 reject-path http_header_edn composition. ADR 0216 headers_edn_append multi-header + uniqueness. ADR 0217 reject-path http_result_err_edn (code scan + retryable gate). ADR 0218 reject-path http_result_ok_edn (status decimal + headers shape + body scan). ADR 0219 reject-path http_request_edn0 (0-header request). ADR 0220 reject-path http_request_edn multi-header (single-export Component twin). ADR 0221/0222 multi-export reject kit body (empty+append+request+results). ADR 0223 true header-name uniqueness via [:set :string] guest record (set-in-record; main -9002). ADR 0224 pure reject-path EDN append + true set uniqueness (main -9002). ADR 0225 Component twin headers-names-add true-set name list (Canonical element equality). ADR 0226 multi-export reject package folds names-add (true-set). ADR 0227 map-element-bound name uniqueness on headers-edn-append (Component + multi-export). ADR 0229 pure multi-export EDN kit body + true-set uniqueness (main -9002). ADR 0230 multi-ns reject package Component project body. ADR 0231 pure kit-shaped request set-of-header-records + name-set (main -9002). ADR 0233 full headers EDN fold via typed-set-nth (main -9002). Multi-file project Component CLI first slice (compiler ADR 0192). W4 recursive nested EDN ADT still open — wasm-aot stays :partial until that gate."}}
